{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/808", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"In Minecraft, what is more valuable than Netherite?\", \"response\": \"In Minecraft, there is currently no item more valuable than Netherite. Netherite is the strongest and most durable material in the game, surpassing even Diamond in terms of strength and durability. It's worth noting that the value of an item can also be subjective and depend on the context of its use within the game. For example, some items may be more valuable for specific tasks or in certain situations. However, in general, Netherite is considered the most valuable material in Minecraft.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "4", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/678", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"Act as a customer service representative for Chime.com\", \"response\": \"Hello, I am a customer service representative for Chime.com. How can I assist you today?\\n\\nHere are some common questions and issues that customers may have:\\n\\n    Account login and password reset\\n    Direct deposit and fund transfer\\n    Card activation and PIN setup\\n    Dispute a transaction\\n    Report a lost or stolen card\\n\\nIf you have any other questions or concerns, please let me know. I am here to help.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "3", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/22", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"Write an interview between Gaius Julius Caesar (12 July 100 BC – 15 March 44 BC), a Roman general and statesman and Alexander III of Macedon (20/21 July 356 BC – 10/11 June 323 BC), commonly known as Alexander the Great,and king of the ancient Greek kingdom of Macedon about the importance of public relations to influence public opinion.\", \"response\": \"Alexander the Great: Thank you for joining me today, Gaius Julius Caesar. As a military leader and statesman, I'm sure you understand the importance of public relations in influencing public opinion.\\n\\nCaesar: Absolutely, Alexander. Public relations is a crucial aspect of leadership, especially in a political or military capacity. It's essential to understand how your actions and words are perceived by the public and how they can impact your reputation and the support you receive.\\n\\nAlexander the Great: That's exactly why I'm here today. I've heard a lot about your successful use of public relations during your time as governor of Gaul and your subsequent rise to power in Rome. I'm curious to learn more about your strategies and how you were able to effectively communicate your message to the public.\\n\\nCaesar: Well, Alexander, my approach to public relations was based on a few key principles. First, I always made sure to communicate a clear and consistent message to the public. Whether it was through public speeches or through my actions, I made sure that my goals and intentions were always clear.\\n\\nAlexander the Great: That's an important point. Consistency is key when it comes to messaging. How else did you ensure that your message was received positively by the public?\\n\\nCaesar: I made sure to involve the public in my decisions whenever possible. I understood that the people of Rome and Gaul were the ones who would ultimately support or oppose my actions, so I made sure to listen to their concerns and involve them in the decision-making process whenever I could.\\n\\nAlexander the Great: Involving the public in decision-making is a great way to build trust and support. Did you do anything else to build a positive relationship with the public?\\n\\nCaesar: Absolutely. I made sure to be accessible to the public and to listen to their concerns. I understood that people were more likely to support me if they felt like I was approachable and responsive to their needs.\\n\\nAlexander the Great: That's excellent advice. Accessibility and responsiveness are crucial for building a positive relationship with the public. Did you face any challenges in your public relations efforts?\\n\\nCaesar: Of course. One of the biggest challenges was dealing with negative press or criticism from opponents. In those cases, I made sure to respond in a calm and measured way, always focusing on the facts and the bigger picture. I never allowed myself to be drawn into personal attacks or petty arguments.\\n\\nAlexander the Great: That's a great lesson. It's important to maintain a professional and composed demeanor, even in the face of criticism or opposition.\\n\\nCaesar: Exactly. In the end, it's all about maintaining a clear and consistent message, involving the public in decision-making, and building a positive relationship with the people you serve. If you can do those things, you'll be well on your way to effective public relations and successful leadership.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "4", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/337", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"Here are column names of a spreadsheet called 'Items Proposals': Vendor Line ID Vendor Name Line Item Item Status \\\"GE Item Number \\n (do not complete for new items)\\\" \\\"Reason for Disco\\n (Disco Items Only)\\\" Unit UPC Case UPC Item Description Size UOM Master Casepack Inner Casepack Item Dimensions LxWxH (in inches) Manufacturer Brand Replenishment (Warehouse/ DSD) \\\"Date Avail \\n (New/ Restocked Items Only)\\\" Minimum Order Quantity Subgroup\\n \\n\\n What is this spreadsheet about?\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nIt appears to be a proposal spreadsheet for potential retail products, with details about the vendor, item description, dimensions, and so on. The columns appear to include a vendor name and line item number, a proposed item status, a \\\"GE item number\\\" (likely a Global Exchange part number), a \\\"reason for disco\\\" column (presumably for items that have been discontinued), unit and case UPC codes, item description, size, units of measure, master and inner casepack quantities, item dimensions, manufacturer, brand, replenishment details, availability date, and minimum order quantity. The \\\"subgroup\\\" column may be used for classification or categorization of the items.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nHow certain are you that Disco means 'discontinued' in `Reason for Disco` column?\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nI am reasonably certain that \\\"disco\\\" in the \\\"Reason for Disco\\\" column refers to \\\"discontinued\\\", based on my understanding of the retail industry and the conventions of product proposal spreadsheets. It is common for proposed products that are no longer available from the vendor to be flagged as \\\"disco\\\" in proposal spreadsheets.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nHere are column names titled 'Everyday Financials': \\n Current Everyday SRP Proposed Everyday SRP Current List Selling Unit Cost $ Current EDLC Selling Unit Discount $ \\\"Current Net Selling Unit Cost $\\n (as of today's date)\\\" Proposed List Selling Unit Cost $ Proposed EDLC Unit Discount $ \\\"Proposed Net Selling Unit Cost $\\n (effective xx/xx)\\\" Current IMU % Proposed IMU % Proposed/ Current Cost $ Var Proposed/ Current IMU % Var Unit Sales/ Store/ Week Store Count Sales Units/ Week Sales Weeks in Period Total Annual Sales Units Total Annual Proposed Retail Sales $\", \"response\": \"The 'Everyday Financials' spreadsheet appears to be a pricing and cost analysis for retail products. The column names refer to:\\n \\n\\n * Current and Proposed Everyday SRP: The current and proposed suggested retail price\\n * Current List Selling Unit Cost $ and Proposed List Selling Unit Cost $: The current and proposed cost to the retailer for each unit\\n * Current EDLC Selling Unit Discount $ and Proposed EDLC Unit Discount $: The current and proposed discounts offered for volume purchases\\n * Current Net Selling Unit Cost $ and Proposed Net Selling Unit Cost $: The current and proposed final cost to the retailer after discounts\\n * Current IMU % and Proposed IMU %: The current and proposed initial markup percentage, which represents the difference between the cost and the list price\\n * Proposed/ Current Cost $ Var and Proposed/ Current IMU % Var: The proposed change in cost or markup percentage\\n * Unit Sales/ Store/ Week, Store Count, Sales Units/ Week, Sales Weeks in Period: Various measures of sales volume\\n * Total Annual Sales Units and Total Annual Proposed Retail Sales $: Total annual sales units and the retail value for the proposed prices.\\n \\n\\n The spreadsheet appears to be designed to compare the current and proposed financial metrics for the products and help the retailer make informed purchasing decisions.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "4", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/276", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"I require your assistance to draft some articles.\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nI’m happy to help. Please let me know what the articles are about, and any specific information you want me to include.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nIn my messages that I send you later, I will refer to this information as Information About Myself. \\n \\n\\n Here is a bit of information about myself that I want you to know. I am a solicitor and construction lawyer with more than 10 years experience specialising in construction law. I regularly advise homeowners and builders regarding their contractual and legal rights. I represent homeowners and builders in NSW, Australia as well as all courts of competent jurisdiction. I have advised homeowners, builders, and contractors experience regarding latent conditions. I have advised them on their contract rights, risks and obligations. I have negotiated and amended contracts to reflect their intentions.\", \"response\": \"Thank you for providing me with some information about yourself. As a solicitor and construction lawyer with over 10 years of experience, you have a wealth of knowledge and expertise in construction law, including advising homeowners and builders on their contractual and legal rights, representing clients in court, and providing guidance on latent conditions, contract rights, risks, and obligations. This is valuable information that I will keep in mind as I assist you with drafting articles.\\n \\n\\n If you could please provide me with some specific details about the articles you would like to draft, such as the topic, purpose, and any particular information you would like to include, I would be happy to assist you further.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "4", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/45", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"‘Plea negotiation is widely used in the criminal justice system, yet seldom praised.’ Evaluate the weaknesses \\nof the use of plea negotiation in the criminal justice system\", \"response\": \"Plea negotiation is a widely used procedure in the criminal justice system that allows defendants to plead guilty to a lesser charge in exchange for a reduced sentence. While plea negotiation can be a useful tool for both defendants and prosecutors, it has its weaknesses and limitations.\\n\\nOne of the main weaknesses of plea negotiation is that it can be coercive and unfair to defendants. In many cases, defendants may feel pressured to accept a plea deal, even if they are innocent or feel that they have a strong defense. This is because the alternative to accepting a plea deal may be a longer sentence or even a conviction on more serious charges.\\n\\nAnother weakness of plea negotiation is that it can lead to the conviction of innocent people. In some cases, defendants may feel that they have no choice but to accept a plea deal, even if they are innocent, in order to avoid a longer sentence or conviction on more serious charges. This can result in innocent people being convicted and sent to prison, which is a serious injustice.\\n\\nPlea negotiation can also be criticized for being inefficient and time-consuming. The process of negotiating a plea deal can take up a significant amount of time and resources, which could otherwise be spent on resolving the case through trial. This can lead to delays in the criminal justice system, which can be frustrating for victims and witnesses who may have to wait longer for justice to be served.\\n\\nAdditionally, plea negotiation can be seen as a form of \\\"plea-bargaining,\\\" which is when prosecutors offer reduced sentences in exchange for information or cooperation from defendants. This can be seen as a form of \\\"plea-bargaining,\\\" which is when prosecutors offer reduced sentences in exchange for information or cooperation from defendants. This can be seen as a form of coercion, as defendants may feel pressured to cooperate with prosecutors in order to receive a more favorable sentence.\\n\\nFurthermore, plea negotiation can lead to unequal treatment in the criminal justice system. Not all defendants may have the same access to resources and legal representation, which can result in some defendants receiving more favorable plea deals than others. This can lead to unequal treatment and a lack of fairness in the criminal justice system.\\n\\nIn conclusion, while plea negotiation can be a useful tool in the criminal justice system, it has its limitations and weaknesses. It can be coercive and unfair to defendants, lead to the conviction of innocent people, be inefficient and time-consuming, and result in unequal treatment in the criminal justice system. Therefore, it is important for the criminal justice system to carefully consider the use of plea negotiation and ensure that it is being used in a fair and equitable manner.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "4", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/403", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"if \\\"advanced smart cars\\\" is ```/imagine prompt: Animated cars, sleek metallic bodies with vibrant colors and intricate designs, speedy engines capable of reaching high speeds, advanced technology with touch screen displays and autopilot modes, transformable shapes and dynamic movements, city and race tracks as the backdrop. Mood and atmosphere are intense and energetic, the bright lights and sounds of the city, the adrenaline rush of racing, the excitement of the crowd. The prompt should be realized as a 3D animation, with intricate lighting and shading, dynamic camera movements, and realistic textures and materials. --ar 3:2 --v 4 ```\\nand \\\"insane detailed food product photos of chocolate cake\\\" is ```/imagine prompt: A decadent, multi-layered chocolate cake with a rich, fudgy center, meticulously garnished with intricate swirls of dark chocolate ganache, delicate chocolate shavings, and juicy, plump raspberries. A tiny, gold-dusted raspberry sits at the center of each layer, surrounded by ribbons of smooth, glossy ganache. The cake is set on a gleaming, marble-topped table in a bright, airy room with a high ceiling and expansive windows that let in the soft, dappled light of a sunlit garden. The atmosphere is one of calm, indulgence, and sophistication, with a hint of celebration. The prompt should be realized as a high-resolution digital illustration with a tight focus on the texture and detail of the cake and its surroundings, using fine-line brushes and a subtle, muted color palette with a soft focus background. --ar 2:3 --v 4```\\nthen what is \\\"photorealistic young blonde model\\\" is to\", \"response\": \"\\\"photorealistic young blonde model\\\" is to /imagine prompt: A stunning young blonde model, posing with confidence and grace in a modern, minimalist setting. Her long, silky hair falls in gentle waves down her back, and her bright blue eyes are focused on the camera, conveying a sense of strength and vulnerability at the same time. Her flawless skin is highlighted by a subtle, natural makeup, and her perfectly proportioned figure is showcased in a tight-fitting, white dress that accentuates her curves. The atmosphere is one of sophistication and elegance, with a focus on the beauty and confidence of the model. The prompt should be realized as a high-resolution digital illustration, with a tight focus on the model's facial features, hair, and body, using a range of soft, natural brushes and a subtle, muted color palette. --ar 3:2 --v 4.\\n\\nThis prompt is designed to evoke a sense of beauty, confidence, and elegance, with a focus on the model's natural features and flawless skin. The use of a modern, minimalist setting helps to highlight the model's beauty and grace, while the high-resolution digital illustration captures the intricate details of her facial features, hair, and body. The subtle, muted color palette and soft focus background create a sense of sophistication and elegance, while the tight focus on the model's features conveys a sense of strength and vulnerability. The use of natural brushes and a range of techniques helps to create a photorealistic effect that brings the model to life on the screen.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "3", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/705", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"can you provide academic studies showing how autism in adolescent girls presents differently to boys and is not typically pervasive \", \"response\": \"Yes, there are several academic studies that show how autism in adolescent girls presents differently to boys. Here are a few examples:\\n\\n1. \\\"Autism Spectrum Disorders in Females: Issues in Diagnosis and Assessment\\\" by Susan E. Young, Ph.D., et al. (Journal of Autism and Developmental Disorders, 2012): This study highlights the fact that autism presents differently in females than in males, and that traditional diagnostic criteria may not capture the full range of symptoms in girls. The study also emphasizes the need for gender-specific assessment tools and approaches.\\n\\n2. \\\"Autism Spectrum Disorders in Girls: A Review of Gender Differences in Presentation and Intervention\\\" by Susan E. Young, Ph.D., et al. (Sex Roles, 2015): This review article discusses the unique challenges faced by girls with autism, including the impact of gender norms and the increased risk of co-occurring mental health problems. The article also highlights the need for gender-specific interventions and support.\\n\\n3. \\\"Autism Spectrum Disorders in Girls: A Qualitative Study of the Experiences of Girls, Parents, and Professionals\\\" by Jane M. Murphy, Ph.D., et al. (Journal of Autism and Developmental Disorders, 2017): This study uses qualitative methods to explore the experiences of girls with autism and their parents and professionals. The study found that girls with autism may be more likely to mask or camouflage their symptoms, which can make diagnosis more difficult.\\n\\n4. \\\"The Female Autism Phenotype: A Review of Current Research and Its Implications for Practice\\\" by Jessica L. Troseth, Ph.D., et al. (Journal of Autism and Developmental Disorders, 2019): This review article discusses the unique challenges faced by girls with autism, including the impact of gender norms and the increased risk of co-occurring mental health problems. The article also highlights the need for gender-specific interventions and support.\\n\\nThese studies suggest that autism in adolescent girls may present differently to boys, and that traditional diagnostic criteria may not capture the full range of symptoms in girls. As a result, there is a need for gender-specific assessment tools and approaches, as well as interventions and support that are tailored to the unique needs of girls with autism.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "1", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/243", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"some idea to take photo for old building in street\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nWould you like me to write down some amazing ideas for taking photos of old buildings?\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nwrite amazing ideas\", \"response\": \"Sure, here are some amazing ideas for taking photos of old buildings in the street:\\n \\n\\n 1. Try different angles: Experiment with different angles and perspectives to capture the unique features of the building. Try shooting from above, below, or at an angle to create an interesting composition.\\n \\n\\n 2. Use the surroundings: Use the surroundings of the building to add context and create a more interesting photo. For example, include trees, cars, or people in the frame to show the building's scale and give a sense of place.\\n \\n\\n 3. Play with light and shadow: Take advantage of the natural light to create interesting light and shadow patterns on the building's facade. Try shooting at different times of the day to see how the light changes and affects the photo.\\n \\n\\n 4. Focus on details: Zoom in on interesting details of the building, such as architectural features, graffiti, or worn-out paint. These details can add texture and character to your photo.\\n \\n\\n 5. Try black and white: Old buildings often have a timeless feel that can be enhanced by converting the photo to black and white. This can also help to remove distractions and focus on the building's lines and textures.\\n \\n\\n 6. Use a wide-angle lens: A wide-angle lens can help capture the entire building in a single frame and give a sense of the building's scale in relation to its surroundings.\\n \\n\\n 7. Experiment with long exposure: If there is not much traffic on the street, try using a long exposure to create a sense of movement and blur. This can add a sense of drama to the photo.\\n \\n\\n 8. Try double exposure: Double exposure is a technique where two different images are overlaid on top of each other. Try superimposing a person or object onto the building to create a surreal effect.\\n \\n\\n 9. Use a drone: If you have access to a drone, try taking photos of the building from above. This can give a unique perspective and show the building's relationship to its surroundings in a whole new way.\\n \\n\\n 10. Be creative: Don't be afraid to try new things and be creative. Experiment with different techniques and see what works best for you and your subject.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "4", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/988", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"I'm going to an interview at an ERP company tomorrow. Previously, he worked for a semiconductor solution supplier for 3 years. The reason for leaving the company was that the company did not own the data and passed it away.\\n If the interviewer asks, 'Why are you moving to the ERP industry when the semiconductor industry is doing well?', how would you respond?\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nIt’s hard to predict exactly what the interviewer will ask, but it seems likely that they will want to know what led you to choose to apply to their company, and why you want to move into the ERP industry.  \\n For the first question, you could mention that you were attracted to the company because of its reputation and success, and because of your interest in its products and services. As for the second question, you could explain that you’re interested in the ERP industry because you think it offers interesting and challenging work, and you believe you could make a valuable contribution.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nThe name of the company going to the interview is DOUZONE. The business of this company is as follows.\\n ERP business: Extended ERP, Standard ERP, Lite ERP, ERP expansion solution\\n Platform business: business platform, big data platform, accounts receivable factoring, electronic finance\\n Solution business: EBP, groupware, information security, electronic tax invoice/electronic finance, electronic fax\\n D-Cloud Center-based public/private cloud, certified electronic document center, IDC\\n Future business: Fintech, healthcare, e-commerce, etc.\", \"response\": \"Here are some potential responses to the question \\\"Why are you moving to the ERP industry when the semiconductor industry is doing well?\\\":\\n \\n\\n 1. Interest in the ERP industry: You could highlight your interest in the ERP industry and explain that you are excited about the potential to work in a growing and dynamic field. You could mention that you have been following the industry and have a strong interest in the technology and the potential for innovation in the space.\\n \\n\\n 2. Desire to make a positive impact: You could emphasize your desire to make a positive impact on businesses and organizations by helping them to optimize their processes and improve their efficiency. You could explain that the ERP industry is well-positioned to help businesses achieve these goals, and that you are eager to contribute to this effort.\\n \\n\\n 3. Interest in working with a leading ERP company: You could express your enthusiasm for the opportunity to work with a leading ERP company like Douzone. You could highlight the company's reputation, its track record of success, and its commitment to innovation and excellence. You could also mention that you are excited about the potential to learn from and work alongside some of the industry's brightest minds.\\n \\n\\n 4. Desire for career growth and development: You could explain that you are interested in the ERP industry because you see it as a field with significant growth potential. You could mention that you are eager to develop new skills and gain valuable experience working in the industry, and that you believe this opportunity with Douzone will provide you with the perfect platform to do so.\\n \\n\\n Overall, the key is to be honest and authentic in your response, and to highlight your genuine interest in the ERP industry and the potential to make a positive impact through your work.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "4", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/126", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"hi, l am happy to be with you chatgpt\", \"response\": \"Hello! I'm happy to be here and help you with anything you need.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "3", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/856", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"What are the major reasons that the Roman Empire fell? Discuss these significant reasons, the timelines and how they collectively determined the fall of the Roman empire.\", \"response\": \"According to History Today on their blog (history.com), the following are why one of the most legendary empires came crashing down.\\n\\n* **Invasions by Barbarian tribes**:\\n\\n The most straightforward theory for Western Rome’s collapse pins the fall on a string of military losses sustained against outside forces. Rome had tangled with Germanic tribes for centuries, but by the 300s, “barbarian” groups like the Goths had encroached beyond the Empire’s borders. The Romans weathered a Germanic uprising in the late fourth century, but in 410, the Visigoth King Alaric successfully sacked Rome. The Empire spent the next several decades under constant threat before “the Eternal City” was raided again in 455, this time by Vandals. Finally, in 476, the Germanic leader Odoacer staged a revolt and deposed Emperor Romulus Augustulus. From then on, no Roman Emperor would ever rule from a post in Italy, leading many to cite 476 as the year the Western Empire suffered its death blow.\\n\\n \\n\\n* **Economic troubles and Overreliance on slave labor**\\n\\nEven as Rome was under attack from outside forces, it was crumbling from within, thanks to the severe financial crisis. Constant wars and overspending had significantly lightened imperial coffers, and oppressive taxation and inflation had widened the gap between the rich and the poor. In the hope of avoiding the taxman, many members of the wealthy classes fled to the countryside and set up independent fiefdoms. At the same time, the empire was rocked by a labor deficit. Rome’s economy depended on enslaved people to till its fields and work as craftsmen, and its military might have traditionally provided a fresh influx of conquered people to put to work. But when the expansion slowed in the second century, Rome’s supply of enslaved people and other war treasures began to dry up. A further blow came in the fifth century when Vandals claimed North Africa and began disrupting the empire's trade by prowling the Mediterranean as pirates. With this economy faltering and its commercial and agricultural production declining, the Empire started to lose its grip on Europe.\\n\\n \\n\\n* **The Rise of the Eastern Empire**\\n\\nThe fate of Western Rome was partially sealed in the late third century when Emperor Diocletian divided the Empire into two halves- the Western Empire seated in Milan and the Eastern Empire in Byzantium, later known as Constantinople. The division made the empire more easily governable in the short term, but the two halves drifted apart. East and West failed to work together to combat outside threats adequately, and the two often clashed over resources and military aid. As the gulf widened, the largely Greek-speaking Eastern Empire grew wealth while the Latin-speaking West descended into an economic crisis. Most importantly, the strength of the Eastern Empire served to divert Barbarian invasions to the West. Emperors like Constantine ensured that the city of Constantinople was well-guarded and fortified. Still, Italy and the city of Rome- which only had symbolic value for many in the East- were left vulnerable. The Western political structure would finally disintegrate in the fifth century, but the Eastern Empire endured in some form for another thousand years before being overwhelmed by the Ottoman Empire in the 1400s.\\n\\n \\n\\n* **Overexpansion and Military Overspending**\\n\\nAt its height, the Roman Empire stretched from the Atlantic Ocean to the Euphrates River in the Middle East, but its grandeur may have also been its downfall. With such a vast territory to govern, the empire faced an administrative and logical nightmare. Even with their excellent road systems, the Romans could not communicate quickly or effectively enough to manage their holdings. Rome struggled to marshal enough troops and resources to defend its frontiers from local rebellions and outside attacks. By the second century, Emperor Hadrian was forced to build his famous wall in Britain to keep the enemy at bay. As more and more funds were funneled into the military upkeep of the empire, technological advancements slowed, and Rome’s civil infrastructure fell into despair.\\n\\n* **Government Corruption and Political instability**\\n\\n If Rome's sheer size made it difficult to govern, ineffective and inconsistent leadership only served to magnify the problem. Being the Roman Emperor had always been a particularly dangerous job, but it nearly became a death sentence during the tumultuous second and third centuries. Civil war thrust the empire into chaos, and more than 20 men took the throne in the span of only 75 years, usually after the murder of the predecessor. The Praetorian Gaurd- the Emperor's personal bodyguards - assassinated and installed a new sovereign at will and once even auctioned the spot off to the highest bidder. The political rot also extended to the Roman Senate, which failed to temper the excesses of the Emperors due to its own widespread corruption and incompetence. As the situation worsened, civic pride waned, and many Roman citizens lost trust in their leadership.\\n* **Christianity and the loss of traditional values**\\n\\n The decline of Rome dovetailed with the spread of Christianity, and some have argued that the rise of the new faith helped contribute to the Empire's fall. The Edict of Milan legalized Christianity in 313 and later became the state religion in 380. These decrees ended centuries of persecution but may have also eroded the traditional Roman Value Systems. Christianity displaced the polytheistic Roman religion, which viewed the Emperor as having a divine status and also drifted away from the glory of the state and onto a sole deity.\\n*\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "3", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/320", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"Explain all the Vibhaktis in Sanskrit with an exaple for each\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nVibhakti is the 8th case in Sanskrit and is used to indicate an action in the past. Here are the vibhaktis, with some example sentences:\\n \\n\\n Nominative: Ram\\n \\n\\n Accusative: Rama\\n \\n\\n Genitive: Rama\\n \\n\\n Dative: Rama\\n \\n\\n Ablative: Rama\\n \\n\\n Vocative: Rama\\n \\n\\n I’m not sure what you mean by “an exaple for each”. Do you want me to give an example sentence for each vibhakti?\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nJust use one single word for all the examples\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nI think you mean one single sentence, not word. But I think I understand your meaning. Let me see if I can find a single sentence that uses all the vibhaktis... Here’s one: “Rama jayate vibhaktatam abhaktatam.” This translates as “Rama is victorious in the vibhakti, and is also victorious in the abhakti.” Here “vibhakti” means the 8th case, and “abhakti” means the 9th case, so this sentence uses all the vibhaktis.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nCant you just use the word \\\"Ram\\\" for all the vibhaktis and form an example\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nSure, that would work: “Ram vibhakte jayate” translates as “Ram is victorious in the vibhakti.”\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nThese are just 7, you mentioned 8 earlier\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nI’m sorry, I’m afraid I made a mistake. There are only 7 vibhaktis.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nIsn't there a Vocative case as well?\", \"response\": \"Yes, you are correct. The Vocative case is the 8th case in Sanskrit and is used to address someone directly. Here are the vibhaktis, with some example sentences:\\n \\n\\n Nominative: रामः (Rāma)\\n Accusative: रामम् (Rāmam)\\n Genitive: रामस्य (Rāmasy)\\n Dative: रामम् (Rāmam)\\n Ablative: रामम् (Rāmam)\\n Vocative: राम (Rāma)\\n Here is an example sentence that uses all the vibhaktis: \\\"रामः जयते रामम् रामस्य दत्ते रामम् रामः जयते\\\" (Rāma jayate rāmam rāmasya datte rāmam rāma jayate) which translates to \\\"Rāma is victorious in the nominative, Rāma is victorious in the accusative, Rāma is victorious in the genitive, Rāma is victorious in the dative, Rāma is victorious in the ablative, and Rāma is victorious in the vocative.\\\"\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "3", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/810", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"Explain dialectical materialism in simple terms\", \"response\": \"Dialectical materialism is a way of understanding the world that focuses on the interactions between opposing forces or contradictions. It is based on the idea that everything in the world is constantly changing and evolving, and that these changes are driven by the struggle between different classes, groups, or ideas.\\n\\nAccording to dialectical materialism, material reality is the foundation of everything in the world, including our thoughts and beliefs. Our ideas and beliefs are shaped by our material conditions, such as our social and economic status, and they in turn shape the material world around us. Everything in the world, including nature and society, is subject to the laws of dialectics, which means that everything is interconnected and constantly changing and evolving.\\n\\nOne of the key principles of dialectical materialism is that contradictions are the driving force of change and development. Contradictions refer to the opposing forces or tensions that exist within any given system, such as the conflict between the rich and the poor, or the conflict between tradition and modernity. These contradictions can lead to conflict and struggle, but they also drive progress and development as the opposing forces push against each other and create new solutions and forms of organization.\\n\\nAnother important aspect of dialectical materialism is the idea of class struggle. According to this perspective, society is divided into different classes that have conflicting interests and goals. The struggle between these classes is what drives social change and development, and it is through this struggle that new forms of organization and governance can emerge. For example, the struggle between the working class and the capitalist class can lead to the development of new forms of social organization, such as socialism or communism, that aim to distribute resources more equitably and give workers more control over the means of production.\\n\\nOverall, dialectical materialism is a way of understanding the world that emphasizes the interconnectedness of everything in the world, the importance of contradiction and struggle in driving change and development, and the role of class struggle in shaping social organization and progress. It provides a framework for understanding how the material world shapes our ideas and beliefs, and how our ideas and beliefs can shape the material world in return.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "3", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/394", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"What is a proxy?\", \"response\": \"A proxy is an intermediary server that acts as a go-between for requests from clients and servers. Proxies are commonly used to cache frequently requested web pages to improve performance, to provide anonymity and privacy protection, to control access to resources, and to route requests to different servers based on policies.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "3", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/139", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"Are you really sorry?\", \"response\": \"I'm sorry, but as an AI language model, I don't have emotions and I don't experience regret. I can only respond based on the information and data I have been trained on. If you have any other questions or if there's anything else I can help you with, please let me know.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "2", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/187", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"please provide a business plan for a tech company to provide GPT-3 consulting services\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nHere’s an outline of a business plan for a tech company to provide GPT-3 consulting services:\\n \\n\\n -  Description of the company and its services\\n -  Market research on the demand for GPT-3 consulting services\\n -  Business strategy for the company, including marketing and sales plans\\n -  Financial projections for the company\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nplease provide extensive details and generate each of the outline bullet points\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nOK, here are the detailed points for each section of the business plan:\\n \\n\\n -  Description of the company and its services: The company would be a consulting firm specializing in providing advice and assistance to businesses and organizations wishing to utilize GPT-3, a powerful new natural language processing technology. The company would offer a wide range of services including software implementation, data analysis, and training and support for GPT-3 users.\\n -  Market research on the demand for GPT-3 consulting services: There is currently a growing demand for GPT-3 consulting services, due to the increasing popularity of the technology. Businesses and organizations are recognizing the potential benefits of GPT-3, and are seeking expert assistance in utilizing the technology. The market for GPT-3 consulting services is expected to grow rapidly in the coming years.\\n -  Business strategy for the company, including marketing and sales plans: The company’s business strategy would focus on providing high quality GPT-3 consulting services to businesses and organizations. The company would market its services through various channels including trade shows, advertisements, and social media. The company would also develop partnerships with other GPT-3 providers to expand its customer base.\\n -  Financial projections for the company: The company is expected to generate significant revenues in its first year of operation. Revenues are expected to grow rapidly in the following years, as the demand for GPT-3 consulting services continues to increase. The company is expected to be highly profitable within a few years.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nPlease provide an Executive Summary for the business\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nThe executive summary for the business plan is as follows:\\n \\n\\n The company is a consulting firm specializing in providing advice and assistance to businesses and organizations wishing to utilize GPT-3, a powerful new natural language processing technology. The company is expected to generate significant revenues in its first year of operation, and to be highly profitable within a few years. The company’s business strategy focuses on providing high quality GPT-3 consulting services to businesses and organizations. The company will market its services through various channels including trade shows, advertisements, and social media. The company will also develop partnerships with other GPT-3 providers to expand its customer base.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nPlease provide a Market Analysis\", \"response\": \"The market for GPT-3 consulting services is currently growing rapidly, due to the increasing popularity of the technology. Businesses and organizations are recognizing the potential benefits of GPT-3, and are seeking expert assistance in utilizing the technology.\\n \\n\\n According to a market research report, the global natural language processing (NLP) market is expected to grow at a compound annual growth rate (CAGR) of 12.2% from 2021 to 2028, reaching a value of $19.8 billion. The GPT-3 technology is a significant contributor to this growth, as it offers powerful natural language processing capabilities that can be utilized by businesses and organizations.\\n \\n\\n The demand for GPT-3 consulting services is particularly strong in industries such as healthcare, finance, and retail, where the technology can be used to automate tasks such as customer service and data analysis. In addition, the demand for GPT-3 consulting services is expected to be strong in regions such as North America and Europe, where businesses and organizations are more likely to have the resources to invest in the technology.\\n \\n\\n The market for GPT-3 consulting services is expected to become increasingly competitive in the coming years, as more companies enter the market. However, the growing demand for the technology is expected to offset this competition, and the market is expected to continue to grow at a rapid pace.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "3", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/458", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"I am using an Aura-based experience builder site. On the site  I have a lwc that I have enabled Light DOM for. I am doing this because I want to target a child button element from a sibling Aura component that is using an external Js library called IntroJS. IntroJs needs to target an element in order to attatch tour steps.\\n\\nAfter enabling the Light DOM, I am able to enter the chrome console and use document.Query selector and I get a result however when I use document.querySelector from the Aura component I get null. Why is that?\", \"response\": \"There are a few reasons why document.querySelector might be returning null when used from an Aura component with Light DOM enabled:\\n\\n1. Incompatibility between Aura and LWC: It's possible that the IntroJS library is not compatible with LWC components, and may not be able to properly target child elements within an LWC component. To resolve this issue, you could try using an alternative library that is designed to work with both Aura and LWC components, or try using a different approach to attach tour steps to your button element.\\n\\n2. Lack of accessibility: When you enable Light DOM for an LWC component, the component is no longer accessible to Aura components. This means that Aura components cannot directly interact with the child elements of an LWC component, and may not be able to properly target them using document.querySelector. To resolve this issue, you could try using a different approach to communicate between the Aura and LWC components, such as using events or inter-component communication.\\n\\n3. Misunderstanding of the Light DOM: It's important to understand that the Light DOM is a separate DOM tree from the main DOM tree of the page. This means that child elements within an LWC component are not automatically visible to Aura components, and vice versa. When you enable Light DOM for an LWC component, the component is no longer part of the main DOM tree, and its child elements are not automatically accessible to Aura components. To resolve this issue, you could try using a different approach to make the child elements of the LWC component accessible to the Aura component, such as using the @api decorator to expose the element as a property, or using a custom event to communicate between the two components.\\n\\nOverall, it's important to carefully consider the interaction between Aura and LWC components when designing a Salesforce application. By understanding the differences between the two component models and using the appropriate techniques for communication and accessibility, you can create a more seamless and effective user experience for your users.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "3", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/213", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"what are examples of personal values?\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nI can think of honesty, kindness, and respect. These are the three core values of my personal code of ethics. I also value excellence, as I believe in giving my best effort in everything I do. Other examples of personal values include hard work, determination, and loyalty.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\ngive me more\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nSure, here are 10 more examples of personal values:\\n \\n\\n 1. Creativity\\n \\n\\n 2. Honesty\\n \\n\\n 3. Fairness\\n \\n\\n 4. Caring\\n \\n\\n 5. Humility\\n \\n\\n 6. Modesty\\n \\n\\n 7. Friendliness\\n \\n\\n 8. Friendliness\\n \\n\\n 9. Respect\\n \\n\\n 10. Self-control\\n<extra_id_1>User\\ngive me 10 more\", \"response\": \"Sure, here are 10 more examples of personal values:\\n \\n\\n 1. Loyalty\\n \\n\\n 2. Trustworthiness\\n \\n\\n 3. Dependability\\n \\n\\n 4. Flexibility\\n \\n\\n 5. Adaptability\\n \\n\\n 6. Optimism\\n \\n\\n 7. Confidence\\n \\n\\n 8. Courage\\n \\n\\n 9. Tenacity\\n \\n\\n 10. Justice\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "4", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/352", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"what should I expect in a seminar on \\\"From axioms to synthetic inference rules via focusing\\\"\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nThe talk will be about a new framework for adding inference rules to sequent systems, and how that framework can be extended to handle certain classes of non-logical axioms. The main idea is to add inference rules in a way that respects the well-established proof-theoretic properties of sequent systems, while still allowing for a broad class of inference rules. The speaker will demonstrate this using the example of a hypothetical syllogism.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nhypothetical syllogism \\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nThat’s right, the talk will focus on a hypothetical syllogism, and will demonstrate how the new framework can be used to add a synthetic inference rule for it. The main idea is to add a new rule that respects the usual proof-theoretic properties of sequent systems, while still allowing for a broad class of inference rules.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\ncan you tell more about synthetic inference rules \\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nSure, synthetic inference rules are just inference rules that are added to sequent systems in a way that respects the proof-theoretic properties of the original system. In the case of the hypothetical syllogism, the new rule will add a new inference step to the usual sequent calculus, while still preserving the usual properties of cut-elimination and consistency. This will allow for a broad class of inference rules that are compatible with the sequent calculus.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\ncan you suggest references on this topic\", \"response\": \"Certainly! Here are some references on the topic of \\\"From axioms to synthetic inference rules via focusing\\\":\\n \\n\\n  1. \\\"Focusing and the Addition of Inference Rules to Sequent Systems\\\" by Dan Ghica and Paul Taylor, in the Journal of Automated Reasoning, 2010.\\n  2. \\\"Focusing and the Addition of Non-Logical Axioms to Sequent Systems\\\" by Dan Ghica and Paul Taylor, in the Journal of Logic and Computation, 2011.\\n  3. \\\"Focusing and the Addition of Inference Rules to Natural Deduction Systems\\\" by Dan Ghica and Paul Taylor, in the Journal of Automated Reasoning, 2012.\\n  4. \\\"Focusing and the Addition of Inference Rules to Linear Logic\\\" by Dan Ghica and Paul Taylor, in the Journal of Logic and Computation, 2013.\\n  5. \\\"Focusing and the Addition of Inference Rules to Hybrid Systems\\\" by Dan Ghica and Paul Taylor, in the Journal of Automated Reasoning, 2014.\\n  6. \\\"Focusing and the Addition of Inference Rules to Affine Logic\\\" by Dan Ghica and Paul Taylor, in the Journal of Logic and Computation, 2015.\\n  7. \\\"Focusing and the Addition of Inference Rules to Intuitionistic Logic\\\" by Dan Ghica and Paul Taylor, in the Journal of Automated Reasoning, 2016.\\n  8. \\\"Focusing and the Addition of Inference Rules to Classical Logic\\\" by Dan Ghica and Paul Taylor, in the Journal of Logic and Computation, 2017.\\n  9. \\\"Focusing and the Addition of Inference Rules to Constructive Set Theory\\\" by Dan Ghica and Paul Taylor, in the Journal of Automated Reasoning, 2018.\\n  10. \\\"Focusing and the Addition of Inference Rules to Type Theory\\\" by Dan Ghica and Paul Taylor, in the Journal of Logic and Computation, 2019.\\n \\n\\n These papers provide a detailed introduction to the focusing method and its applications in adding inference rules and axioms to various logical systems.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "0", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/532", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"Suggest a plot for a short science day skit\", \"response\": \"A team of scientists are working on a machine that can predict the weather with 100% accuracy, but when they finally get it working, they realize that it predicts a massive solar flare that will destroy the Earth in 24 hours. The rest of the skit follows the team as they scramble to find a way to stop the solar flare and save the planet.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "4", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/452", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"What is the fan in an AWG made of?\", \"response\": \"The fan in an AWG (Air-to-Water Heat Exchanger) is typically made of plastic or metal. The material used depends on the specific design of the AWG and the operating conditions.\\n\\nPlastic fans are typically used in smaller, portable AWGs and are made of materials such as polypropylene or polyethylene. These fans are lightweight and cost-effective, but they may not be as durable as metal fans.\\n\\nMetal fans, such as aluminum or stainless steel, are used in larger AWGs and are more durable than plastic fans. They can handle higher air pressures and temperatures, making them suitable for use in industrial or commercial applications.\\n\\nThe fan in an AWG is responsible for drawing in ambient air and passing it over the heat exchanger. The heat exchanger transfers the heat from the air to the water, which is then used for various applications such as cooling, heating, or generating electricity.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "3", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/796", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"What is the strongest character in game of thrones?\", \"response\": \"In Game of Thrones, there are several characters who could be considered among the strongest in terms of physical prowess, strategic abilities, and magical powers. Here are a few of the strongest characters:\\n\\n1. Jon Snow: Jon Snow is a skilled warrior and leader who has survived multiple battles and has a deep understanding of the White Walker threat. He is also very skilled with a sword and has proven himself to be a brave and strategic leader.\\n\\n2. Daenerys Targaryen: Daenerys is a powerful sorceress who has a unique ability to control dragons. She is also a skilled military leader and has gathered a powerful army of warriors and allies.\\n\\n3. Cersei Lannister: Cersei is a cunning and ruthless politician who has taken control of the Iron Throne and is one of the few characters who has the power to match Daenerys in terms of magical abilities.\\n\\n4. Arya Stark: Arya is a skilled warrior and assassin who has undergone extensive training in combat and the use of weapons. She is also very clever and resourceful, and has shown herself to be a formidable opponent in battle.\\n\\n5. Tyrion Lannister: Tyrion is a smart and savvy politician who has served as the Hand of the King (and Queen) on multiple occasions. He is also a skilled strategist and has a deep understanding of human nature.\\n\\nUltimately, the strongest character in Game of Thrones varies depending on the situation and the specific skills required for a given challenge. These characters are all formidable in their own right and have played a critical role in shaping the fate of the Seven Kingdoms.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "4", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/32", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"I live in Australia. I am thinking about purchasing a car. It will be mostly a town car, but it might every once in a great while have to make a trip from Canberra to Sydney. I would like to be environmentally friendly and go electric, but I am concerned about the lack of charging stations for electric cars. A hybrid car may be the solution since I don't have to use a charging station. I am not necessarily committed to buying a new car and would consider buying a pre-owned car. Our driveway makes a car with a low clearance problematic, so an SUV might be a possibility. What would you recommend?\", \"response\": \"Here are some recommendations based on your needs and preferences:\\n\\n1. Electric car: If you're looking to be environmentally friendly and reduce your carbon footprint, an electric car could be a good option. However, you may need to plan ahead and map out charging stations along your route from Canberra to Sydney. Some popular electric cars in Australia include the Tesla Model 3, the Hyundai IONIQ Electric, and the Kia Niro EV.\\n\\n2. Hybrid car: If you're concerned about the lack of charging stations for electric cars, a hybrid car could be a good compromise. You can still reduce your environmental impact while having the flexibility of a traditional gasoline-powered engine for longer trips. Some popular hybrid cars in Australia include the Toyota Corolla Hybrid, the Hyundai IONIQ Hybrid, and the Honda Accord Hybrid.\\n\\n3. SUV: If you need a vehicle with more space and versatility, an SUV could be a good option. You can still consider hybrid or electric SUVs if you're looking to reduce your environmental impact. Some popular hybrid and electric SUVs in Australia include the Toyota RAV4 Hybrid, the Hyundai Tucson Hybrid, and the Tesla Model Y.\\n\\n4. Pre-owned car: If you're open to buying a pre-owned car, you may be able to find a good deal on a vehicle that meets your needs. You can look for a car with low mileage and a good maintenance history to ensure it's in good condition.\\n\\nWhen considering your options, it's important to do your research and take into account factors such as cost, fuel efficiency, safety features, and reliability. It's also a good idea to test drive different vehicles to get a feel for how they handle and what features you find most important.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "4", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
