{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/421", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"best methods to rich? 10\", \"response\": \"There are many ways to become wealthy, but here are 10 methods that can help:\\n\\n1. Create a budget and stick to it: A budget can help you track your spending and save money each month.\\n\\n2. Invest in stocks: Investing in stocks can help your money grow over time.\\n\\n3. Start a side hustle: A side hustle can be a great way to earn extra income.\\n\\n4. Cut back on unnecessary expenses: Reducing your spending on non-essential items can help you save money.\\n\\n5. Save money automatically: Set up automatic transfers from your checking account to a savings account each month.\\n\\n6. Invest in real estate: Investing in real estate can be a great way to build wealth over time.\\n\\n7. Get a raise: Negotiating a higher salary can help you increase your income.\\n\\n8. Pay off debt: Paying off debt can help you free up money each month to save and invest.\\n\\n9. Invest in yourself: Investing in your education and skills can help you increase your earning potential.\\n\\n10. Create multiple streams of income: Generating multiple streams of income can help you build wealth over time.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "